\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 ACS Pipeline (American Community Survey)
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Acquire:
\f1\b0  Uses \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 ipumsr\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  API. Downloads microdata based on \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 USER_VARIABLES_NEEDED\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 .\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prepare:
\f1\b0  Recodes special codes (e.g., \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 9999999\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 ) to \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 NA\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 . Creates binary \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 indicator_to_plot\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 . Renames \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 HHWT\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  -> \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PERWT\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  and \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 HHINCOME\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  -> \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 HHINCOME\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 .\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Viz:
\f1\b0  Uses \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 weighted.mean\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  with \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PERWT\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 . Standard Single Line plot.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 CPS ASEC Pipeline (Unemployment/Labor)
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Acquire:
\f1\b0  Downloads 
\f0\b two
\f1\b0  datasets (ASEC Supplement + Basic Monthly) via \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 ipumsr\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 .\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prepare:
\f1\b0  Merges ASEC and Basic data using \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 MARBASECIDP\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 . Calculates 
\f0\b U-3
\f1\b0  and 
\f0\b U-6
\f1\b0  rates.\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Viz:
\f1\b0  Generates a 
\f0\b Multi-Line
\f1\b0  plot using \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 ASECWT\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 .\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 CPS Supplement Pipeline (Voting/Civic)
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Acquire:
\f1\b0  Downloads the Supplement file + ASEC Donor file.\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prepare:
\f1\b0  
\f0\b Imputation:
\f1\b0  Maps categorical \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 FAMINC\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  to continuous ASEC \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 HHINCOME\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  using \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 FAMINC_RANGES\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 . Adjusts for inflation.\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Viz:
\f1\b0  Uses \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 VOSUPPWT\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  (or specific supplement weight) and imputed income.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 GSS Pipeline (General Social Survey)
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Acquire:
\f1\b0  
\f0\b Manual Ingest
\f1\b0 . Loads a local \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 .sav\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  file using \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 haven\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 , converts names to lowercase, generates a codebook, and saves as RDS.\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prepare:
\f1\b0  
\f0\b Critical Fix:
\f1\b0  Must strip \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 <haven_labelled>\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  classes using \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 as.numeric()\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  to prevent math errors. Jitters categorical income (e.g., \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 income16\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  codes 1-26) into continuous \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 real_inc_approx\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 . Renames \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 wtssnrps\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  -> \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PERWT\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 .\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Viz:
\f1\b0  Standard \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 weighted.mean\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  logic.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 NHIS Pipeline (National Health Interview Survey)
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Acquire:
\f1\b0  Uses \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 ipumsr\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 . Downloads data (e.g., \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 ih2018\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 ) via DDI.\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prepare:
\f1\b0  
\f0\b Income Jittering:
\f1\b0  Extends the top-code range (e.g., $100k-$850k) to simulate the high-earner tail. Renames \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 WTFA_A\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  -> \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PERWT\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 .\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Viz:
\f1\b0  
\f0\b Unique:
\f1\b0  Uses the \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 survey\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  package (\cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 svydesign\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  -> \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 svyby\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 ) to handle complex variance (\cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PPSU\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 , \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PSTRAT\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 ). Does NOT use simple \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 weighted.mean\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 .\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 NCVS Pipeline (National Crime Victimization Survey)
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Acquire:
\f1\b0  
\f0\b Manual Ingest
\f1\b0 . Loads a specific \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 .rda\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  file from a source path (e.g., \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 ncvs_household_2023.rda\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 ).\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prepare:
\f1\b0  
\f0\b Factor Trap Fix:
\f1\b0  Uses a helper function \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 value_numeric()\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  to convert factor levels (like "0 crimes") to their actual values, not their index. Jitters income codes 1-18. Renames \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 V2116\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  -> \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PERWT\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 .\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Viz:
\f1\b0  Standard \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 weighted.mean\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  logic.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	7	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 UIED Pipeline (Urban Institute Education Data)
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Acquire:
\f1\b0  
\f0\b Smart Ingest
\f1\b0 . Uses \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 smart_ingest()\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  to recursively scan folders for keywords (enrollment, absence) to find files even if filenames vary or are nested.\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prepare:
\f1\b0  Aggregates 
\f0\b School
\f1\b0  level data to 
\f0\b District
\f1\b0  level (\cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 leaid\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 ). Bridges \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 leaid\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  (NCES ID) to the Income Database's \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 TL_GEO_ID\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  (Census ID). Maps \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 Enrollment\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  -> \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PERWT\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 .\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Viz:
\f1\b0  Treats Districts as the unit of analysis, weighted by student enrollment.\
